    "Restore Editor Defaults…" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "恢复编辑器默认值…" } } } },
    "Restore editor defaults?" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "恢复编辑器默认值？" } } } },
    "Toolbar colors and every annotation-tool default will return to their original values." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "工具栏颜色和所有标注工具默认值都将恢复为初始状态。" } } } },
    "Changes apply immediately. Before a toolbar color is removed, you choose its replacement." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "更改会立即应用；删除工具栏颜色前会让你选择替代颜色。" } } } },
    "The toolbar palette will return to red, orange, yellow, green, blue, and purple. Tool defaults using removed colors will switch to red." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "工具栏调色板将恢复为红、橙、黄、绿、蓝、紫。使用已移除颜色的工具默认值将切换为红色。" } } } },
    "Replacing removes custom palette colors and redirects affected tool defaults to red. Keeping custom colors restores the factory colors in their standard order, then preserves custom colors. Existing annotations are unchanged." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "替换会移除调色板中的自定义颜色，并将受影响的工具默认值改为红色；保留自定义颜色会按标准顺序恢复默认颜色，并保留自定义颜色。已有标注不会改变。" } } } },
    "Manage Toolbar Palette" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "管理工具栏调色板" } } } },
    "HEX" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "HEX" } } } },
    "Enter a color in #RRGGBB format." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "请输入 #RRGGBB 格式的颜色。" } } } },
    "This color is already in the toolbar palette." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "这个颜色已经在工具栏调色板中。" } } } },
    "The swatch and HEX value will appear together in the toolbar menu." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "色块和 HEX 数值会一起显示在工具栏菜单中。" } } } },
    "Remove" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "移除" } } } },
    "Remove color %@, %@" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "移除颜色 %@，%@" } } } },
    "Choose Replacement Color" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "选择替代颜色" } } } },
    "Any tool currently using %@ will use the replacement. Existing annotations will not change." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "当前使用 %@ 的工具将改用替代颜色；已有标注不会改变。" } } } },
    "Replacement" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "替代颜色" } } } },
    "Replace and Remove" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "替换并移除" } } } },
    "Font size must be between 8 and 96 px." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "字号必须在 8 到 96 px 之间。" } } } },
    "Line width must be between 1 and 24." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "线宽必须在 1 到 24 之间。" } } } },
    "The font size is outside the supported range for the selected unit." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "字号超出了所选单位支持的范围。" } } } },
    "The line width is outside the supported range for the selected unit." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "线宽超出了所选单位支持的范围。" } } } },
    "The rectangle corner radius is outside the supported range for the selected unit." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "矩形圆角半径超出了所选单位支持的范围。" } } } },
    "The selected color could not be converted to sRGB." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "所选颜色无法转换为 sRGB。" } } } },
    "Red" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "红色" } } } },
    "Orange" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "橙色" } } } },
    "Yellow" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "黄色" } } } },
    "Green" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "绿色" } } } },
    "Blue" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "蓝色" } } } },
    "Purple" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "紫色" } } } },
    "Custom" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "自定义" } } } }
  },
  "version" : "1.0"
}
